      "end_ms": 102500,
      "text": "Tight profile close-up of Juliana gripping the rusted iron bars, screaming out into the empty stone corridor.",
      "line_number": 276,
      "duration_ms": 2900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP029_B064",
